  "title": "Chapter 45: Industries in India",
  "order": 45,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lpd94vl",
      "content": "Industries play an important role in the economic development of a country. Industrialization leads to large-scale production, employment generation, technological advancement and economic growth. India has a diversified industrial structure including traditional industries, modern industries and service-based industries."
    },
    {
      "type": "statStrip",
      "stats": [
